sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: How a click works
  accDescr: A click goes from the screen to ReferralContext to the workflow rules. If allowed, the updated referral is saved to localStorage and every screen updates. If not, nothing changes and the user sees an error.
  actor U as User
  participant P as Screen
  participant C as ReferralContext
  participant W as Workflow rules
  participant S as localStorage

  U->>P: Click an action
  P->>C: Call the action
  C->>+W: Check and apply it
  alt Allowed
    W-->>C: Updated referral with timeline and audit entries
    C->>S: Save everything
    C-->>P: Every screen updates
    P-->>U: Success message
  else Not allowed
    W-->>C: Reason
    C-->>P: Nothing changes
    P-->>U: Error message
  end
  deactivate W
